1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,032
Afghanistan ke naqshe mein ek ajeeb si lambi dum kyun hai?

2
00:00:04,582 --> 00:00:11,394
Isay kehte hain Wakhan Corridor. Takreeban 350 kilometer lambi ek patli si patti.

3
00:00:11,944 --> 00:00:16,620
Iske upar Tajikistan hai, neeche Pakistan, aur aakhri sire par China.

4
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:25,494
Ek jagah ye sirf 13 kilometer chaudi hai. Yani Pakistan aur Tajikistan ke beech bas Afghanistan ki ek patli si lakeer.

5
00:00:26,044 --> 00:00:33,264
Wajah thi Great Game. Unneesvi sadi mein British India aur Russian Empire ek doosre ki taraf barh rahe the.

6
00:00:33,814 --> 00:00:42,834
To 1893 aur 1895 ke muahidon mein ye patti Afghanistan ke hisse mein daal di gayi, taake dono saltanatein kabhi aapas mein na milein.

7
00:00:43,384 --> 00:00:51,972
Iska aakhri sira China se milta hai. Sirf 92 kilometer ki sarhad, aur Wakhjir Pass takreeban 4,900 meter ki unchai par.

8
00:00:52,522 --> 00:01:02,142
Aaj bhi yahan sirf takreeban 18 hazaar log rehte hain. Ek naqsha, jo do saltanaton ke dar se bana. Aise aur raaz ke liye follow karein!
